{{/*
  Agent Observatory repo tab (V9 T06).

  Install as $GITEA_CUSTOM/templates/custom/extra_tabs.tmpl on CT100 (Gitea),
  then restart Gitea. See docs/gitea-custom/README.md for the version-pinned
  spike this was verified against and the full install/upgrade checklist.

  BEFORE INSTALLING:
  1. Confirm OBSERVE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL is set on CT103 (agent-control-plane
     .env) -- do NOT install this file while it is unset (H8 fail-closed: no
     Observe tab is safer than a tab pointing at an inert/wrong host).
  2. Replace OBSERVE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL_PLACEHOLDER below with that exact
     literal value (scheme+host, no trailing slash, e.g.
     https://control.ham-sup-lo.com). Gitea's Go templates cannot read the
     control-plane's environment -- this is a one-time static substitution
     performed by a human, not a live lookup.
  3. If OBSERVE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL is ever unset or changed on CT103, this file
     must be edited (or removed) here and Gitea restarted to match; a stale
     value here is a dangling/incorrect link, not a functional break in
     agent-control-plane itself.
*/}}
<a class="item" href="OBSERVE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL_PLACEHOLDER/observe/repos/{{.Repository.OwnerName}}/{{.Repository.Name}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
	{{svg "octicon-pulse"}} Observatory
</a>
